<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-t">本地备份</view>
    <view class="small muted" style="line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16rpx">备份保存当前本机全部空间、房间、家具、物品、库存与历史数据到本地文件。恢复会覆盖当前数据，请谨慎操作。</view>
    <button class="btn primary" bindtap="createBackup">创建本地备份</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row between">
      <view class="card-t">备份记录</view>
      <text class="muted small" bindtap="load">刷新 ▸</text>
    </view>
    <view class="bk-item" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="row between">
        <view class="grow">
          <view class="strong">{{item.note}}</view>
          <view class="muted small">{{item.time}} · {{item.recordCount}} 条记录</view>
        </view>
        <button class="btn sm" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="restore">恢复</button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="empty-line" wx:if="{{!loading && list.length===0}}">还没有备份记录</view>
    <view class="empty-line" wx:if="{{loading}}">加载中…</view>
  </view>

  <view class="foot-note">备份数据仅存于本机用户目录，不上传云端。清除小程序缓存会同时删除备份文件。</view>
</view>
